            "notes": "Background Information:\nYou should take  [Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1) if you're not getting dived or rushed, but I'll take   [Think Flash](item_3bce3ff6-cbf3-4515-b5cb-648f536a1d37) if I'm gettin run over by Genji/Queen or  [Barrel Roll](item_c5368723-a7c9-4124-9bc1-7749917b0c8a) against a D.Va comp. \n\n\n\nPower ability:\n[Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1)  to reduce your roll cooldown by 30% on a headshot. \n\nItem: \nI really like taking  [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) as it is a HUGE boon to survivability. You could take the following items though. \n\n\n [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) \nIt's a really compelling item if you're fighting enemy DPS like genji or Freyr, but you can alternatively take  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if you're fighting against an Orisa, Dva, or Reinhardt. We're mostly interested in the 15% boost to damage.\n\nIf the enemy have an Ana and you're getting slept/naded or a Zenyatta, I've been taking  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) as it makes a big difference for surviability. Remove any of the other survival items but ensure you can take at least the  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with it.",
