            "notes": "Background:\nIf I took competitive analysis I'll typically grab  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) but you could also take  [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) if they're running a very aerial based comp (Juno, Genji, D.va, Freyr, etc.) It's great against a Genji using the double jump. \n\n\nItems:\n [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) \n [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) \n [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n\nThen you should be ensuring you have optimal survivability, which I'll take  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) or  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) then the rest survivability like  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or even  [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900)",
