            "notes": "Background:\nBy now you should have a firm understanding as to how the enemy team are playing and if you need more or less survivability. \n\nI'll typically sell  [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) if I can for  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) or  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). \n\nPower items:\nIn terms of power items, it's really a choice between extra distance (if you're needing to reposition, or getting swamped by tanks, like DVA/Rein) or if you want to leave a flashbang behind. I do like to get  [Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1) though so grab it if you haven't already. \n\nItems\n [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) OR  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) \n\n [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n\n [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) \n\nFill the rest of the slots up with the optional items, preferring survival items if you need additional survivability.",
