            "notes": "Background:\nI've played games where I've been able to have all six epics in round 6, which is possible if you're earning 10-12k per round, typically from MVP bonuses but as of late this has been really challenging. \n\nThat said, your decisionmaking around items should be to maximise weapon damage whilst ensuring survival. \n\nItems: \nWe ideally want to take the following:\n [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)\n [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) \n [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n\nThen:\n\n[Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) OR  [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) \n\n\nI'll then grab two survival items. Typically if I didn't take  [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) I'll grab  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) for the lifesteal.",
